        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now I have a clear picture. Here are the two issues and fixes:\n\n## Issue 1: Vibration not firing\n`SharedStorage.vibrationEnabled` defaults to `false`. It only gets set to `true` during the onboarding demo or through a complex notification enable flow. If the user skipped or completed onboarding differently, vibrations never work.\n\n## Issue 2: Background detection unreliable\nThe health check and background task renewal use `Timer.scheduledTimer` \u2014 but **RunLoop timers are suspended when the app is in background**. So when the audio engine stops in background, the health check never fires to recover it. Also, `configureBackgroundAudioSession()` sets up the audio session but **never restarts the audio engine** if it stopped.\n\nLet me fix both:"
        }
      ],
      "timestamp": "2026-03-10T22:33:34.319Z",
      "input_tokens": 42331,
      "output_tokens": 1,
      "cumulative_tokens": 875545
    },
